# EdStack login / credits callout copy

## Unsigned credits callout (`SignInCreditsCallout`)

Use this exact string from `branding.ts` — no per-app variants:

```ts
export const SIGN_IN_CREDITS_CALLOUT_TEXT =
  `Sign up includes ${FREE_SIGNUP_CREDITS} free credits to use across all EdStack apps.`
```

With `linkSignIn`, render linked “Sign in — ” then `SIGN_IN_CREDITS_CALLOUT_TEXT`.

## Login page subtitle

Do **not** show muted copy like “Create an account to use … credits and purchase top-up packs.”
The callout already covers signup credits. Only show a muted note when billing is not ready
(e.g. “Accounts and billing are being rolled out…”).
